{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：11:26 2026-08-19 HKT<br/>發佈時間：11:26 2026-08-19 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：11:26 2026-08-19 HKT</p><p>深水埗北河街115號，今（19日）早上10時31分，地底電纜突爆火花爆開渠蓋，途人紛紛走避，警方接獲多個報案，指有火花及傳出爆炸聲，消防接報到場，開喉射水，火警迅速被救熄，事件中無人受傷，亦毋須疏散。警方封鎖現場進行調查。</p><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/9e40f7e146ef11b5361fe49354f13c35/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-19_at_11_04_04.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/fc92f39e392f272b3a6134567360a67e/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-19_at_11_04_03_1_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"消防射水救火。劉漢權攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/6e3eadb4de4d44a41dd6a1da4c8843b9/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-19_at_11_04_03.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"警方封鎖現場調查。劉漢權攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/6290b03516afc180aa72735e4ba768fd/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-19_at_11_04_02_3_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/504c57cc42c115ce6119738e11803fb3/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-19_at_11_04_02_2_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"渠蓋爆開。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/bf1e2a0e1c9803bcde554a3886080d18/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-19_at_11_04_02_1_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/ceec05585819c4967afbd8c47938ebf2/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-19_at_11_04_01.jpeg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-19T03:39:55.880480+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":194,"images":7,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"}}